Cell["\<\
but worth noting of course that we only use a small fragment of it (I scaled \
the image size up by 10\[Times] so we can actually see it...)\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8217374271952333`*^9, 3.821737443679819*^9}, {
  3.821737539914991*^9, 3.821737562960561*^9}, {3.8217376213816547`*^9, 
