   3.821368125814356*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dbc4c01b-4f3e-4521-993c-\
141cbadc9486"],

Cell["\<\
and that left part is cleanly invertible as expected and is just our new \
perturbation operator, so  \
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.821359439213727*^9, 3.821359470163265*^9}, {
  3.8213595311170197`*^9, 3.8213595347447643`*^9}, {3.821359585750023*^9, 
