  ExpressionUUID->"31667887-f42d-4b0d-8578-1595dd142adc"],
 ", but keep anything lower, and in fact we can do this in a clean, iterative \
way that allows us to not do too much extra work at each iteration"
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.828056801911832*^9, 3.828056858061997*^9}, {
  3.828056921245344*^9, 
