 "So first we can do a resolution of the identity to split ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["A", "n", 
    RowBox[{"(", "k", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9f060ee2-b81b-4a86-a3c5-eb8984905912"],
