Cell["\<\
and what is notable here is that we can write this in a form that looks like\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.827944660162045*^9, 
  3.827944675778894*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ae7e223f-8409-4d22-bb0a-\
