   3.82794475178718*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a0d63e16-23c9-426d-8fe5-\
313548eb1b03"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "the specific form of this is not clear yet, but we can do it. Even more \
importantly, though, ",
 StyleBox["we will be adding up every possible form like this",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". This is a direct product of the fact that we are summing over all \
possible ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c18b8711-43a3-4821-a32d-ce1542389101"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["q", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b19b363d-6273-4cdc-ae5a-15c6a59060ed"],
 ", all possible ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["M", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "96c15b6f-2607-4da8-b7dc-a2e73d843374"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["N", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3e00d0a5-f7e0-4440-b4e2-3d4e395cf814"],
 ", and all power sets of terms. That means that when we have"
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.827944756473208*^9, 
  3.8279448637148647`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a8093ef7-2578-48cf-a652-\
21a355675d2a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    RowBox[{"i", "=", "0"}], "k"], 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["n", 
       RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]},
     "Bra"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["A", "n", 
     RowBox[{"(", "i", ")"}]], 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]", "n"], 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]", "m"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["A", "m", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"k", "-", "i"}], ")"}]], 
    TemplateBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["m", 
       RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]},
     "Ket"]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.827944864769253*^9, 
  3.827944872506962*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"35f3d364-fc7d-430f-a758-\
3063f1abf681"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "we\[CloseCurlyQuote]re covering every single combination of these terms. \
This will allow us to rewrite our terms in surprisingly simplified forms, \
once we work through all the appropriate partitionings of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["M", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "98f92bf0-b222-4505-b4bc-8ffee9dac948"],
 " and whatnot."
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.827944873957952*^9, 
  3.8279449432018642`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f1c5553a-e0cd-4980-a3c0-\
34608177fc0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "and the others will clearly have the same form, just with different \
indices. Especially relevant for us will be the term ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[GothicCapitalC]", "n"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"M", ",", " ", "p", ",", " ", "v"}], ")"}], "\[AlignmentMarker]", 
   
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]", "n"], 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]", "m"], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["C", "m"], "(", 
    RowBox[{"N", ",", " ", "q", ",", " ", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.827927708996932*^9, 3.827927709917281*^9}, {
   3.827928839929926*^9, 3.827928876592609*^9}, {3.827928921221084*^9, 
   3.827929101037245*^9}, {3.827930619535906*^9, 3.827930658311532*^9}, {
   3.8279308302625933`*^9, 3.8279308537460403`*^9}, {3.827930884327218*^9, 
   3.827930902776805*^9}, {3.827931430180189*^9, 3.8279315274224453`*^9}, {
   3.8279316273674994`*^9, 3.827931742524001*^9}, {3.827931853135491*^9, 
   3.827931861164875*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "cda0307f-3686-4f41-8f97-8ecb79d4ddfb"],
 ", since we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll hope that this will cancel with "
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8279337835713997`*^9, 3.8279337940585833`*^9}, {
  3.8279342210065117`*^9, 3.827934221697175*^9}, {3.827934294968305*^9, 
  3.827934324450446*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a1d60f26-6023-47a6-ba4e-\
ac38c4d6e5fb"],

