   3.828451433387369*^9, 3.8284514417561007`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "e16737fb-4783-4c13-9e3b-f7bbddc9d45b"],
 "we just end up taking a convolution of this term with the power-set sum of \
other terms."
}], "ExpositoryText",
