 "and we use the degeneracy/commutativity properties to say ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["P", 
      SuperscriptBox["D", 
       RowBox[{"(", "a", ")"}]]], 
