  "f5b58459-1502-4aeb-abb6-ba72da58bdad"],
 " we\[CloseCurlyQuote]re golden. So we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll recall that "
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8258209245590563`*^9, 3.825820933777534*^9}, {
