  3.8269850308459167`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bbbc1e1d-85e3-44d3-9df4-\
82f2ff2fddb2"],

Cell["\<\
At its weakest, this theorem provides us a rigorous way to bound our error, \
by defining some radius\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8269858372737007`*^9, 3.826985868999153*^9}, {
   3.8269859353920116`*^9, 3.82698594149279*^9}, {3.826985981361739*^9, 
