Cell["\<\
which actually I don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t see a way to reduce...this is weird, \
since the near degeneracy tells us that the error we make in applying the \
inductive hypothesis is controllable, but this one doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
seem to be?\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.827008407004788*^9, 
