Cell["\<\
which is looking promising, like we should be able to build a simple way to \
express this, but it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s not totally clear yet, so we\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll just merge it all as\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.825903824380435*^9, 
