  3.889895039143745*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"95e0a3c7-5819-429a-8aa9-\
1eb51a897f90"],

Cell["To get at we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll first put the terms in a canonical \
form as", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8898950495197077`*^9, 3.889895054113943*^9}, {
  3.889895127610949*^9, 3.889895130604185*^9}, {3.889895183809217*^9, 
