c0df569c5765"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "and then we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll split up the ",
 StyleBox["crossing",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " terms (where the change in quanta is greater than the shift and opposite \
in sign) into their two pure ascending and pure descending parts like"
}], "ExpositoryText",
