  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "ccd6be6e-e25a-4ffe-ae0f-702dea81c7ad"],
 ") and then if we are heading ",
 StyleBox["towards",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " zero we add on as many terms as steps we have taken, in practice, this \
means"
}], "ExpositoryText",
