 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " may depend we'll define the derivative element-wise such that"
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769990464772297*^9, 3.769990490361908*^9}, {
  3.769992333749329*^9, 3.769992368266141*^9}, {3.7700019098220263`*^9, 
  3.770001973612178*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1804a5f9-17a3-4bac-bcaf-\
7755bb407a5e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
       RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", "x"}]], "A"}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["i", "1"], 
       SubscriptBox["i", "2"]}], "..."}], 
     SubscriptBox["i", "n"]}]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
     RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", "x"}]], 
    SubscriptBox["A", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["i", "1"], 
        SubscriptBox["i", "2"]}], "..."}], 
      SubscriptBox["i", "n"]}]]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7699904924994373`*^9, 3.76999050935362*^9}, {
   3.769992337932426*^9, 3.769992338500615*^9}, {3.769992370979871*^9, 
   3.769992398409739*^9}, 3.770001929405431*^9, {3.7700019823656673`*^9, 
   3.7700020018598623`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"486dac2b-337a-48d0-b6f3-\
01a236a41bc4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We will also define derivative tensors such that given a vector of \
coordinates ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["x",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "39e6a6d1-6aaa-44c0-bea6-5758d674bb12"],
 " and a scalar function ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770002160689776*^9, 3.7700022227574*^9}, {
  3.770002707596692*^9, 
  3.770002708676879*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"18f61126-64d3-48f1-a6ec-\
c922810d2a75"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "f"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
      RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
       SubscriptBox["x", "1"]}]], GridBox[{
       {"f", 
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "2"]}]], "f"}], "\[CenterEllipsis]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
           RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
            SubscriptBox["x", "n"]}]], "f"}], ")"}]}
      }]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770002213007545*^9, 
  3.770002256412961*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"32340c56-7519-4faa-8167-\
9db1e67c83aa"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "if instead of scalar ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " we have a tensor ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " everything is basically the same but we get the tensor of derivatives"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7700026914286737`*^9, 
  3.7700027926352253`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"31277b3c-9c2a-424d-a97f-\
e33e2452a462"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Higher dimensional tensor derivative operators may also be defined, e.g. \
given another vector of coordinates ",
 StyleBox["y",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " we can have"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770002795050787*^9, 
  3.7700028301625423`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c59da7cd-fb30-4637-b71f-\
d06dd4908fb3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Del]", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}]], "f"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
      {GridBox[{
         {"", 
          RowBox[{
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "2"], 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
              SubscriptBox["x", "1"]}], 
             RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
              SubscriptBox["y", "1"]}]}]], "f"}]}
        }], 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "2"], 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "1"]}], 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "2"]}]}]], "f"}], "\[CenterEllipsis]", 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "2"], 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "1"]}], 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "m"]}]}]], "f"}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "2"], 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "2"]}], 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "1"]}]}]], "f"}], " ", " ", 
       ItemBox["\[VerticalEllipsis]",
        Alignment->Center]},
      {
       ItemBox["\[VerticalEllipsis]",
        Alignment->Center], " ", "\[DescendingEllipsis]", " "},
      {
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "2"], 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "n"]}], 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "1"]}]}]], "f"}], "\[CenterEllipsis]", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "2"], 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "n"]}], 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "m"]}]}]], "f"}]}
     }], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.77000283324442*^9, 3.770003042944219*^9}, {
  3.770476502284219*^9, 3.770476511768778*^9}, {3.770476609545226*^9, 
  3.770476625886256*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"106000d6-0c45-40d6-817b-\
8f4867bd01f6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Chain Rule", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770002010099448*^9, 
  3.770002023347224*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5491c530-7a8c-4c36-8ad0-\
cccdec5079b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll define the chain rule over a tensor of derivatives \
in the standard kind of way by supplying a Jacobian for the transformation, \
e.g. given a vector of coordinates ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["x",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bfa4f55e-ded8-44ae-b8eb-53edc6628d6a"],
 " and a function ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and a set of coordinates upon which ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " depends, ",
 StyleBox["y",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ","
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770002025115212*^9, 3.770002145338221*^9}, {
  3.770003087148337*^9, 
  3.770003155253934*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ee785ebd-8c0f-45b7-97c7-\
7c1820f8cfbf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], 
    StyleBox["f",
     FontSlant->"Italic"]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "y"}], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "y"], 
     StyleBox["f",
      FontSlant->"Italic"]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",\

 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770002127205385*^9, 3.7700021517883863`*^9}, 
   3.7700026678233433`*^9, {3.770003159573106*^9, 
   3.7700031958995123`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f26e9a10-071f-4f6b-86bf-\
bea38a30a795"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The same basic form holds for higher dimensional derivative tensors, e.g. \
given a vector valued function ",
 StyleBox["g",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770004018239903*^9, 
  3.7700040760625677`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2a6da116-4854-44ed-8a4f-\
f0c6a79ae099"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "g"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "y"}], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "y"], "g"}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770004047825358*^9, 
  3.770004061238752*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e521b905-fae3-4c8a-bc24-\
3b0d9e63c174"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "And for a general derivative tensor for a tensor valued function ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7700041180456257`*^9, 3.770004201100398*^9}, {
  3.7700042445859613`*^9, 
  3.770004260313706*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c3fce079-e0b1-4030-bdfe-\
6586ee936100"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "A"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "y"}], "\[CircleDot]", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "y"], "A"}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770004171103174*^9, 3.7700041727573357`*^9}, {
  3.770004204212248*^9, 3.770004212428071*^9}, {3.770004247922552*^9, 
  3.770004274138248*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dad0aff5-5bca-45c6-8e79-\
de68cfb67960"],

Cell["where \[CircleDot] is the tensor dot operation talked about later", \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770004278193158*^9, 
  3.770004295417157*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"39fc7b23-768c-4548-bfcc-\
aab13c65f0d6"],

Cell["\<\
We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll also note that this still works in a slightly \
different form with univariate derivatives\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.793373511793545*^9, 3.7933735540232697`*^9}, {
  3.793374243600436*^9, 
  3.7933742659516993`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"208d83b2-116b-4ba7-81cf-\
ae9008550c03"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
     RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
      SubscriptBox["x", "i"]}]], "f"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "y"}], ")"}], "i"], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "y"], 
     StyleBox["f",
      FontSlant->"Italic"]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",\

 CellChangeTimes->{{3.793373555201318*^9, 3.793373556818019*^9}, {
  3.793373621553999*^9, 
  3.793373640091936*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5b21fe24-71c5-42b9-9eda-\
7e4cdcff7ec7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Proof", "Subsubsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770003243789435*^9, 
  3.770003244365432*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4acc5e88-e54a-4add-a425-\
7fb57ffcab4f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Case 1:", "Subsubsubsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7700040862141933`*^9, 
  3.770004096117775*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"047eb4fd-0633-4554-bbca-\
fc37b777fa34"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[GridBox[{
    {
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], 
         StyleBox["f",
          FontSlant->"Italic"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontSlant->"Italic"]}], "i"], "=", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
        RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
         SubscriptBox["x", "i"]}]], 
       StyleBox["f",
        FontSlant->"Italic"]}]}]},
    {
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
        RowBox[{"j", "=", "1"}], "N"], 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
          SubscriptBox["y", "j"]}], 
         RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
          SubscriptBox["x", "i"]}]], 
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "j"]}]], 
         StyleBox["f",
          FontSlant->"Italic"]}]}]}]}]},
    {
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "y"}], ")"}], "i"], "\[CenterDot]", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "y"], 
        StyleBox["f",
         FontSlant->"Italic"]}]}]}]}
   }], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770003256663847*^9, 
  3.770003415532247*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9bf4f966-2784-4d9e-8149-\
6fad2ec94773"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Case 2:", "Subsubsubsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770004089757992*^9, 
  3.7700040907659607`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b2efe5f2-2d56-4099-804c-\
3654ef5362d8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[GridBox[{
    {
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "g"}], ")"}], "ij"], "=", 
      SubscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["x", "i"]}]], "g"}], ")"}], "j"]}]},
    {
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
        RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
         SubscriptBox["x", "i"]}]], 
       SubscriptBox["g", "j"]}]}]},
    {
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", "k"], 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
          SubscriptBox["y", "k"]}], 
         RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
          SubscriptBox["x", "i"]}]], 
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
           SubscriptBox["y", "k"]}]], 
         SubscriptBox["g", "j"]}]}]}]}]},
    {
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "x"], "y"}], ")"}], "i"], "\[CenterDot]", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Del]", "y"], 
         SubscriptBox["g", "j"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontSlant->"Italic"]}]}]}]}
   }], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770003520660696*^9, 
  3.770003708747065*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dbfc253a-b027-49a9-a5f0-\
a6296eed9061"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Case 3:", "Subsubsubsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.77000429961685*^9, 
  3.7700043016248417`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"70cc9984-8880-44c6-a6d3-\
6881b8c37ba6"],

Cell["Left to reader", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7700043040510683`*^9, 
  3.770004307731063*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ee82322c-c16d-4cd4-90e0-\
9ed11aad24cf"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Tensor Dot", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769963077084485*^9, 3.769963083724461*^9}, 
   3.770001540532054*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f7dae8f6-2818-4cc4-96be-\
52b13f313f59"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Definition", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769963086084334*^9, 
  3.769963087444317*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5d22b898-71a9-475d-a2fd-\
a82b09b0ad8c"],

Cell["\<\
We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll define the tensor dot \[CircleDot] to be a binary \
tensor operation that generalizes the dot product. It will operate \
recursively such that:\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.76996308876696*^9, 
  3.769963136907378*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0f26a755-868e-4b66-a382-\
139b05656b86"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Given a vector ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " of length ",
 StyleBox["N",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and tensor ",
 StyleBox["B",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " with primary dimension ",
 StyleBox["N ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll define this such that"
}], "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769963138738771*^9, 3.769963150876833*^9}, 
   3.7699640238516006`*^9, 3.769964055094274*^9, {3.769964155927177*^9, 
   3.769964166750581*^9}, {3.7699642774413023`*^9, 3.76996430800032*^9}, {
   3.7699643905468893`*^9, 3.769964393019726*^9}, {3.76996446883495*^9, 
   3.769964498073822*^9}, {3.769979534521368*^9, 
   3.769979539960401*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2c5e9624-eba3-40dc-ac01-\
46e55bbb2e65"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"a", 
    StyleBox["\[CircleDot]",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "B"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
      RowBox[{"i", "=", "1"}], "N"], "\[VeryThinSpace]"], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["a", "i"], 
     SubscriptBox["B", "i"]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",\

 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769964168513081*^9, 3.7699641846545*^9}, {
  3.769964284553358*^9, 3.769964361951352*^9}, {3.769964477251569*^9, 
  3.769964516761362*^9}, {3.769979400082197*^9, 3.769979400458305*^9}, {
  3.792780898504198*^9, 3.792780898855813*^9}, {3.793290707373557*^9, 
  3.793290707635263*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c374ae85-aa6b-4012-94df-\
23d35d60b614"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Given a tensor ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " with primary dimension ",
 StyleBox["N ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "and innermost dimension ",
 StyleBox["M",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and a tensor ",
 StyleBox["B",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " with primary dimension ",
 StyleBox["M",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll define this such that"
}], "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769963138738771*^9, 3.769963150876833*^9}, 
   3.7699640238516006`*^9, 3.769964055094274*^9, {3.769964155927177*^9, 
   3.769964166750581*^9}, {3.7699642774413023`*^9, 3.76996430800032*^9}, {
   3.769964388748302*^9, 3.769964403499324*^9}, {3.769964538297079*^9, 
   3.769964588968831*^9}, {3.7699795436573*^9, 
   3.769979552136466*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e54d7484-caea-48ef-b1d9-\
5b0ca01a86e8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"A", 
    StyleBox["\[CircleDot]",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "B"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["A", "1"], "\[CircleDot]", "B"}], 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["A", "2"], "\[CircleDot]", "B"}], "\[CenterEllipsis]", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["A", "N"], "\[CircleDot]", "B"}]}
     }], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769964168513081*^9, 3.7699641846545*^9}, {
  3.769964284553358*^9, 3.769964361951352*^9}, {3.76996440911539*^9, 
  3.7699644651340513`*^9}, {3.769979397761972*^9, 3.769979398538382*^9}, {
  3.792780896076523*^9, 3.7927808967844133`*^9}, {3.7932907057758427`*^9, 
  3.793290706139489*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bca998a4-53b7-446c-9b5c-\
3cef41c63aa3"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Property 1 (associativity)", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7699645970274067`*^9, 3.769964597675084*^9}, {
   3.769964647891058*^9, 3.769964662330751*^9}, 3.769983565504298*^9, {
   3.77047539474004*^9, 3.770475401443068*^9}, 
   3.7704775062031317`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f7575af7-99e9-40a3-ace5-\
7493e7574a66"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Given", " ", 
    StyleBox["A",
     FontWeight->"Bold"]}], ",", " ", 
   StyleBox["B",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["C",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], " ", "tensors"}], ","}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMath",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769983121540217*^9, 3.7699832275859423`*^9}, {
  3.769984200501495*^9, 3.769984200505658*^9}, {3.770475447314399*^9, 
  3.770475453953335*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"36b20702-e302-499c-99a1-\
1ad31130e972"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"A", "\[CircleDot]", "B"}], ")"}], "\[CircleDot]", "C"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"A", "\[CircleDot]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"B", "\[CircleDot]", "C"}], ")"}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7699832294205503`*^9, 3.769983246713925*^9}, {
  3.77047545917738*^9, 
  3.770475476040778*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d338c902-ca12-4edc-ac6f-\
90e8a68ca16d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Proof", "Subsubsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769983837143515*^9, 
  3.769983837863821*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"91f63eb3-cb69-4a3f-91b8-\
fba2d1e1ab28"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox["LTR", TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMath",
