b32f8b14b238"],

Cell["\<\
Basically a tensor dot is a simpler version of einsum where we only contract \
along the inner dimensions, e.g.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.769983272737082*^9, 3.76998330945646*^9}, {
  3.7699833445922117`*^9, 3.769983349687621*^9}, {3.769983412998705*^9, 
