  3.8119880317832193`*^9, 
  3.81198804914458*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7d695633-2c85-4cba-a376-\
4ae590784914"],

Cell["\<\
but the perturbation operator is actually incredibly simple in the harmonic \
basis, giving us\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
