Cell["\<\
and it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s clear that we need the even-ness of the indices to \
match up on the left and right. So in the future we can programmatically \
generate these cases.\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8121080957475767`*^9, 3.8121081570300703`*^9}, {
   3.812108233814351*^9, 3.812108245975926*^9}, {3.812108705067919*^9, 
