   3.8121104376711473`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"87f6e243-9a28-435e-adb3-\
e824d9f32d80"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "And we see they are broadly factorizable in terms of expansions in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"n", "+", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "00db3089-1247-4299-af20-25c7716e11a1"],
 "!"
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.812110342066977*^9, 
  3.812110371713316*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fe8db4f4-1659-4f83-9294-\
9f7a1c40a477"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "These can then potentially be factored into their contributions from the \
different actions, which would allow us to build something like an x-matrix, \
or even better, could be used to generate energies which than can be ",
 StyleBox["fit",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " to an x-matrix form."
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.812204261000496*^9, 3.812204288679243*^9}, {
  3.81220734900019*^9, 3.812207353001947*^9}, {3.813454617194779*^9, 
  3.813454673502695*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1f4b97c5-ea35-4da8-9810-\
f3f16123d0bb"]
}, Open  ]],

