Cell[TextData[{
 "and all of this tells us what we could basically have guessed: ",
 StyleBox["we have a negative phase when we raise and odd number of times \
using ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "p. In algorithmic terms, that means if we have a permutation/sequence of \
raising lowering operations, e.g."
}], "ExpositoryText",
