          SubscriptBox["\<\"\[Omega]\"\>", "\[FormalI]"], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["\<\"\[Omega]\"\>", "\[FormalJ]"], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["\<\"\[Omega]\"\>", "\[FormalK]"]}], ")"}]}]]}]}
   },
   DefaultBaseStyle->"Column",
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Column"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8122125359726353`*^9, 3.812212566101018*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[3413]=",ExpressionUUID->"bab5b6bc-174d-484c-ae5e-be1dac1fd1e6"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["General-Purpose Term-Generator", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.81349449824632*^9, 3.8134945042814617`*^9}, {
  3.813494559541469*^9, 
  3.813494574543199*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c30ce54d-d746-4346-b057-\
6d6172bc8289"],

Cell["\<\
The goal is to create a function that can build the expressions used to \
evaluate any term appearing in\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.81349505759076*^9, 3.813495076223255*^9}, {
  3.813495201173458*^9, 
  3.8134952208500853`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9fdcd344-6fbd-455e-ae11-\
2388e021106a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["n", 
      RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]},
    "Bra"], 
   SuperscriptBox["H", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["k", "1"], ")"}]], "\[CapitalPi]", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   SuperscriptBox["H", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["k", "1"], ")"}]], 
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]\[Ellipsis]\[CapitalPi]H", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["k", "M"], ")"}]], 
   TemplateBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["n", 
      RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]},
    "Ket"]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813495077617299*^9, 3.8134950864215918`*^9}, {
  3.813495120624568*^9, 
  3.813495190984735*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"80b2ef17-d558-47ac-b03a-\
9a6181fc76d8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where each ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["H", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["k", "1"], ")"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "704942c2-66d8-4db3-99a4-9173841c50a1"],
 " is going to really be expressed as a set of coefficients attached to an \
operator built out of ",
 StyleBox["p",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["Q",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " terms."
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813495511473073*^9, 3.813495543582402*^9}, {
  3.813495675843696*^9, 
  3.813495682496084*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"076aaba1-e5d8-47ad-9774-\
6f29dfa177ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The key to this is just quantum-number counting. To do that we figure out \
the total-quanta changes that each ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["H", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9bac6d40-f8be-4143-9125-e1208f7fb0c3"],
 " term can effect and then figure out the total set of paths to 0, then add \
up the effects."
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8134954439891853`*^9, 3.813495501903481*^9}, {
  3.813495687170127*^9, 3.813495725989887*^9}, {3.8134957751181307`*^9, 
  3.81349578122158*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1b34aead-7fd7-4e62-9908-\
44efe2462d34"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ladderUpAndDownPaths", "[", 
   RowBox[{"changes", ":", 
    RowBox[{"{", "__Integer", "}"}]}], "]"}], ":=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"Block", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"maxDim", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", "changes", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "displacements"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"displacements", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", "dim", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"Select", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", "dim"}], ",", " ", "dim"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             "maxDim"}], "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], "\[Equal]", "dim"}], 
            "&"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "]"}], "/@", "changes"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", "displacements", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"EqualTo", "[", "0", "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813495852425082*^9, 3.8134958631036158`*^9}, {
  3.81349590027917*^9, 3.813496019044756*^9}, {3.8134960696238832`*^9, 
  3.813496090381879*^9}, {3.813496121053056*^9, 3.813496308402115*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[1407]:=",ExpressionUUID->"1b021b9a-fcee-4765-b261-19042071cb53"],

Cell["\<\
What effect does this have in practice? We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll recall that we \
could write\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813508043606113*^9, 
  3.813508083737705*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"76b2afbc-cd3d-4450-8b3c-\
a7c87ba74de9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox["n", "i"]},
     "Bra"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox["n", "j"]},
     "Bra"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox["n", "k"]},
     "Bra"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["q", "i", 
     SuperscriptBox["a", "\[Prime]"]], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["q", "j", 
     SuperscriptBox["b", "\[Prime]"]], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["q", "k", 
     SuperscriptBox["c", "\[Prime]"]], "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\[CapitalPi]", "\[InvisibleSpace]\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["q", "i", "a"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["q", "j", "b"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["q", "k", "c"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox["n", "i"]},
     "Ket"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox["n", "j"]},
     "Ket"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox["n", "k"]},
     "Ket"]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "=", 
      RowBox[{"-", "a"}]}], "a"], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
      RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "=", 
       RowBox[{"-", "b"}]}], "b"], " ", 
     RowBox[{
      UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", "=", 
        RowBox[{"-", "c"}]}], "c"], " ", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          SubsuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", "\[Alpha]", "a"], "(", 
          SubscriptBox["n", "i"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{
          SubsuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Alpha]"}], 
           SuperscriptBox["a", "\[Prime]"]], "(", 
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["n", "i"], "+", "\[Alpha]"}], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{
          SubsuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", "\[Beta]", "b"], "(", 
          SubscriptBox["n", "j"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{
          SubsuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Beta]"}], 
           SuperscriptBox["b", "\[Prime]"]], "(", 
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["n", "j"], "+", "\[Beta]"}], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{
          SubsuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", "\[Gamma]", "c"], "(", 
          SubscriptBox["n", "k"], ")"}], 
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
          RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]"}], 
          SuperscriptBox["c", "\[Prime]"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["n", "k"], "+", "\[Beta]"}], ")"}]}], 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]\[Omega]", "i"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Beta]\[Omega]", "j"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]\[Omega]", "k"]}]], 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
          RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "\[Beta]", ",", "\[Gamma]", ",", "0"}]]}], 
        ")"}]}]}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813508085146332*^9, 
  3.813508117700481*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"25c22b88-8245-4740-acf5-\
daf4ea7ed622"],

Cell["\<\
and now we can adapt this idea to get a recursive way to express these \
things. \
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813508168290824*^9, 3.813508201623498*^9}, {
  3.813508773602311*^9, 3.813508777877508*^9}, {3.813508827653714*^9, 
  3.8135088280070477`*^9}, {3.8135257142042913`*^9, 3.813525727985618*^9}, {
  3.813525760896079*^9, 3.813525800098302*^9}, {3.8135259529403887`*^9, 
  3.813525959017702*^9}, {3.81352667452813*^9, 3.8135266928777237`*^9}, {
  3.813526783300775*^9, 3.813526787425337*^9}, {3.813531518870264*^9, 
  3.813531521559173*^9}, {3.813531657405417*^9, 3.8135316792874937`*^9}, {
  3.813531739959527*^9, 3.813531805644586*^9}, {3.813532371993909*^9, 
  3.813532374345787*^9}, {3.8135324058078537`*^9, 3.813532491660619*^9}, {
  3.813532614415534*^9, 
  3.8135326190885477`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f7589961-1ef2-4d8f-a79c-\
3ec7369a3585"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let's assume we have operators ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e65de94a-96de-4ba9-a35b-557b304d8e6c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["B", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "47791e28-ea6d-44ad-a354-ebec5a0907c2"],
 " that can change our quanta by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["M", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b07517d5-7522-4f04-a61f-2500a53d534b"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["N", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e48174ca-7a42-486f-bf27-25252101d76c"],
 " respectively. Let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"m", "=", 
    RowBox[{"min", "(", 
     RowBox[{"M", ",", " ", "N"}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "61686950-d670-4cd2-aab3-0c13640ca42b"],
 ". If ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7a7d8c00-8de5-47ad-b7d8-bb8c7abbdb96"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["B ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "are just products of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["Q", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "51d3330b-3c49-487e-920f-f26e74dfdc3a"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "199d3a3c-01bd-468b-9c80-f3b39f7fd42a"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[CapitalPi]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "45f4372d-bfaf-435e-acd1-3d6ecd08b4d5"],
 ", this means that up to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["m", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8ec83ab8-a60f-412a-a99c-d59b14593f3a"],
 " modes can be excited/de-excited. We need to be careful about how we think \
about this partitioning, though, since if we just think about the terms ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"p", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "p"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"b618c3d1-5707-4b2e-8566-f5db67f5bcca"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "Q"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"b9c44f86-1785-4cd6-b9a6-271021c16cde"],
 ", we note that if we want to put excite/de-excite mode ",
 StyleBox["j",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " there is only one way with ",
 StyleBox["QQQ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", namely"
}], "ExpositoryText",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813508168290824*^9, 3.813508201623498*^9}, {
  3.813508773602311*^9, 3.813508777877508*^9}, {3.813508827653714*^9, 
  3.8135088280070477`*^9}, {3.8135257142042913`*^9, 3.813525727985618*^9}, {
  3.813525760896079*^9, 3.813525800098302*^9}, {3.8135259529403887`*^9, 
  3.813525959017702*^9}, {3.81352667452813*^9, 3.8135266928777237`*^9}, {
  3.813526783300775*^9, 3.813526787425337*^9}, {3.813531518870264*^9, 
  3.813531521559173*^9}, {3.813531657405417*^9, 3.8135316792874937`*^9}, {
  3.813531739959527*^9, 3.813531805644586*^9}, {3.813532371993909*^9, 
  3.813532374345787*^9}, {3.8135324058078537`*^9, 3.813532491660619*^9}, {
  3.813532614415534*^9, 3.813532615560906*^9}, {3.813534515823365*^9, 
  3.813534520452216*^9}, {3.813535592535466*^9, 
  3.8135357003638687`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8498f2f4-565d-4515-9017-\
279c9efeb8b4"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["Q", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   SubscriptBox["Q", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   SubscriptBox["Q", "k"]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.81353569095894*^9, 
  3.813535708818531*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b3d02fed-3162-4d1b-ab07-\
c7100456284a"],

Cell["\<\
but with the not-totally symmetric one there are multiple ways\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813535711946797*^9, 
  3.813535722019628*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f83793a9-8d7c-4fbf-a48a-\
b8a43aee0539"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["Q", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["p", "k"]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], 
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["Q", "k"]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["p", "i"], 
    SubscriptBox["Q", "j"], 
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813535723577155*^9, 
  3.813535761083599*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"06e5d692-169f-4850-b0e9-\
34b50b4c7c52"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "which is all just to say, ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["B", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "be432787-9bc5-4331-bccb-6cb2f0723dca"],
 " will contain information about which modes they\[CloseCurlyQuote]re able \
to excite/de-excite. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s call that info \[CapitalDelta], \
which will be a sequence of integers detailing which modes it can excite and \
by how many quanta. That allows us to write"
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8135358074900208`*^9, 3.813535867025334*^9}, {
  3.813535901534411*^9, 3.8135359572313633`*^9}, {3.8135369754254913`*^9, 
  3.813536975983244*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b9441b1a-a58d-4a2e-b162-\
ebef28e8c591"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["n", 
       RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]},
     "Bra"], "A", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[CapitalPi]", "\[InvisibleSpace]\[VeryThinSpace]",
     "B", 
    TemplateBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["n", 
       RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]},
     "Ket"]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["d", "1"], "=", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "1", "B"]}], 
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "1", "B"]], 
    RowBox[{"\[Ellipsis]", 
     RowBox[{
      UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["d", "m"], "=", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "m", "B"]}], 
       SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "m", "B"]], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "(", 
        StyleBox["d",
         FontWeight->"Bold"], ")"}], 
       RowBox[{
        UnderscriptBox["\[Product]", "i"], 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", "A"], "(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox["n", "i"], "+", 
            SubscriptBox["d", "i"]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"-", 
            SubscriptBox["d", "i"]}], ",", " ", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "i", "A"]}], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", "B"], "(", 
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["n", "i"], ",", " ", 
           SubscriptBox["d", "i"], ",", " ", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "i", "B"]}], 
          ")"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "ExpositoryMathCentered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8135257300482273`*^9, 3.813525755870356*^9}, {
   3.813531516548489*^9, 3.813531516906386*^9}, 3.813531583458358*^9, {
   3.813531629273802*^9, 3.813531684353072*^9}, {3.8135324937959747`*^9, 
   3.8135325535842543`*^9}, {3.813532662622539*^9, 3.8135326999613457`*^9}, {
   3.813532731721562*^9, 3.813532851211397*^9}, {3.813533769356995*^9, 
   3.813533779284101*^9}, 3.8135341439008713`*^9, {3.813534279697857*^9, 
   3.813534283011799*^9}, {3.813534737474875*^9, 3.813534750731742*^9}, 
   3.813535869565956*^9, {3.813536955205752*^9, 
   3.8135370220357113`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eb47b02b-ecb8-4f21-9e9c-\
a4ad72122d32"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "(", 
    StyleBox["d",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ff7bcbfb-13e2-4277-8803-f908620dee3d"],
 " is just tracking the effect of the perturbation operator and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", "A"], TraditionalForm]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.8135257300482273`*^9, 3.813525755870356*^9}, {
    3.813531516548489*^9, 3.813531516906386*^9}, 3.813531583458358*^9, {
    3.813531629273802*^9, 3.813531684353072*^9}, {3.8135324937959747`*^9, 
    3.8135325535842543`*^9}, {3.813532662622539*^9, 3.8135326999613457`*^9}, {
    3.813532731721562*^9, 3.813532851211397*^9}, {3.813533769356995*^9, 
    3.813533779284101*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "f997e8b6-5f8e-42fa-b6f9-23928a95cf74"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", "B"], TraditionalForm]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.8135257300482273`*^9, 3.813525755870356*^9}, {
    3.813531516548489*^9, 3.813531516906386*^9}, 3.813531583458358*^9, {
    3.813531629273802*^9, 3.813531684353072*^9}, {3.8135324937959747`*^9, 
    3.8135325535842543`*^9}, {3.813532662622539*^9, 3.8135326999613457`*^9}, {
    3.813532731721562*^9, 3.813532851211397*^9}, {3.813533769356995*^9, 
    3.813533779284101*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "712527ef-cad1-4cd9-952f-b21481d2773b"],
 " just track the coefficients associated with the excitations/de-excitations \
in mode ",
 StyleBox["i",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". "
}], "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813533788338031*^9, 3.813533810130001*^9}, {
   3.813533849779953*^9, 3.8135339109718513`*^9}, {3.813533946195261*^9, 
   3.813533958946566*^9}, {3.813533997906065*^9, 3.8135340237885513`*^9}, {
   3.813534054394307*^9, 3.8135340710267344`*^9}, {3.8135341981198177`*^9, 
   3.813534226081732*^9}, {3.81353487606828*^9, 3.813534880019023*^9}, 
   3.813535961360108*^9},ExpressionUUID->"66012912-122e-4bf8-a474-\
4b05760ffb39"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let's look at a concrete case to make this clearer. We'll look at one of \
the terms in one of the the internal coordinate versions of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["H", 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "130194ab-0f88-4f50-a23d-0603023e1510"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"p", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "i"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\[CapitalPi]", "\[InvisibleSpace]\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["q", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"q", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["q", "i"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b8158fae-9284-408a-b224-2562151bedeb"],
 " (we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll note that by index math ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"p", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "i"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\[CapitalPi]", "\[InvisibleSpace]\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["q", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"q", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["q", "k"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "72bbb93d-0df5-4cae-adbd-1822f04da4b6"],
 " must be zero, since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["q", "k"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "28b9427e-e5cd-420f-a9c4-ca2184bc0bf0"],
 " has to excite ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["n", "k"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "866b7824-1d2a-4ac4-a4c4-6beedb2ec097"],
 " but there\[CloseCurlyQuote]s nothing to bring it back down in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"p", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "i"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"1da54526-566f-43d7-9e1b-00486ed455d5"],
 "). So for this we have ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "i"], "=", "1"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "j"], "=", "2"}]}], "}"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"045beb91-a17f-4615-bd08-1caa5fd9838d"],
 " and while this isn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t required in general, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"p", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "i"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"Q", "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["p", "j"], "\[InvisibleSpace]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"1d6962df-9e3a-4b48-81c2-a55a41d21b74"],
 " has the same possible excitations/de-excitations."
}], "ExpositoryText",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.813533788338031*^9, 3.813533810130001*^9}, {
  3.813533849779953*^9, 3.8135339109718513`*^9}, {3.813533946195261*^9, 
  3.813533958946566*^9}, {3.813533997906065*^9, 3.8135340237885513`*^9}, {
