Cell[BoxData["\<\"D_e\\\\left(1-e^{-\\\\alpha \\\\, \\\\text{$\\\\Delta \
$r}}\\\\right){}^2 = \\\\sum _{i=2}^{\\\\infty }  \\\\frac{(-1)^i}{i\\\\, \
!}\\\\left(2^i-2\\\\right)D_e\\\\, a^i\\\\Delta r^i\"\>"], "Output",
