}, Open  ]],

Cell["and putting this all into dimensionless coordinates we have", \
"ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8438437606279507`*^9, 3.843843768209132*^9}, {
  3.843843801565578*^9, 3.843843806367425*^9}, {3.843843872303609*^9, 
